From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CarlosDLMC <delamorenacoco.carlos@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 08:33:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 12/15] animation: the border colour fades on its own timing
 and curve

animation_duration_border / animation_curve_border time the border (and
shadow) colour change on a focus change apart from the opacity and dim fade
(animation_duration/curve_focus); unset, they follow the focus ones. Hyprland
times them apart (border, fadeSwitch): its border takes 539 ms easeOutQuint
while a terminal's opacity fades in 300 ms smoothOut.
---
 include/mango/animation/common.h |  3 ++-
 include/mango/common/server.h    |  1 +
 include/mango/config/parse.h     |  5 +++++
 src/animation/client.c           | 26 +++++++++++++++++++++-----
 src/animation/common.c           | 10 ++++++++++
 src/config/cleanup.c             |  4 ++++
 src/config/option_defs.c         | 16 ++++++++++++++++
 7 files changed, 59 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

